      "review": [
        "Exercise 3: '감기약을 바로 먹어도 돼요? 왜 그래요?' uses the wrong phrase. '왜 그래요?' means 'What's wrong?' or 'Why are you acting like that?', not 'Why?'. Learners would pick up the wrong meaning. Change it to '왜요?' or '왜 안 돼요?'. Full question: '감기약을 바로 먹어도 돼요? 왜요?'"
      ],
